{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929","id":"msg_01T71qyDuDwLR2EYcpdTqRv2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## ROOT CAUSE ANALYSIS (Phase 1)\n\n### Issue: False character merge - \"the mummer\" merged with Prince Prospero\n\n- **Symptom:** \"the mummer\" appears as an alias of Prince Prospero in the character list, when it should be a separate character (the Red Death)\n- **Data flow trace:**\n  1. Appears in: HTML report output (characters section)\n  2. Stored in: `CharacterMap.characters[0].aliases` (returned by CharacterAgent)\n  3. Generated by: `CharacterAgent.run()` → `CharacterExtractionPipeline.run()` → `CharacterConsensusBuilder.build_consensus()`\n  4. **Originates in:** `src/pipeline/character_extraction/consensus.py` - the LLM pairwise merge decision repeatedly accepts the merge despite context showing they're different\n- **Root cause:** 15 attempts have tried to fix the pre-merge logic (context windows, prompt rules, death detection). ALL have failed. The LLM consistently makes the wrong merge decision. The only option left is POST-PROCESSING remediation.\n- **Confidence:** HIGH - This is documented after 15 failed attempts with detailed analysis\n\n### Fix Approach\n\nSince all pre-merge approaches have failed, I will implement POST-PROCESSING:\n1. After consensus completes, scan each character's mentions/contexts for death evidence\n2. Look for patterns: \"fell prostrate in death the [NAME]\", \"died\", \"[NAME1] pursuing [NAME2]... collapsed dead\"\n3. If two aliases within a single character appear in a death relationship, SPLIT them into separate characters\n\nThis addresses the root cause by working AFTER the incorrect merge has happened.\n\nNow let me implement the post-processing function. I'll add it to the CharacterAgent since it's a verification/refinement step:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5,"cache_creation_input_tokens":330,"cache_read_input_tokens":50800,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":330,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"076185ae-b8e4-4f9d-b6d1-b2359811f632","uuid":"4119470a-646b-475f-a2e3-10ea84459db4"}
